          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Clear, credible US policy commitments (e.g., defined concessions or security guarantees) reduce counterpart uncertainty and create diplomatic leverage, prompting greater momentum, resourcing and participation in mediated talks involving Iran and Gulf actors." />
