          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising domestic political pressure (from polarized constituencies, interest groups, and donors reacting to the war) pushes the executive and differing congressional blocs toward contradictory demands and postures, increasing executive–legislative friction over foreign policy and funding decisions." />
