          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A decline in capital flows into AI (a buildout bust) produces layoffs, revenue shortfalls and fiscal strain in electorally important tech and supplier sectors, increasing domestic political pressure on governments to reprioritize spending and constrain foreign assistance; conversely rising capital flows relieve that pressure." />
