          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A surge in AI-directed capital (VC, PE, sovereign allocations) attracts foreign LPs, syndication and cross‑border M&amp;A, directly raising the volume of cross‑jurisdictional tech finance." />
