          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sharp increase in corporate AI investment finances concentrated lobbying, trade‑association pressure and industry‑backed rulemaking petitions that push legislators and regulators to adopt deregulatory language and delay restrictive rule rollouts, shifting net regulatory direction toward deregulatory outcomes." />
